          <li>
            🔒 Browsing history stays local; shortcuts remain in Apple's
            Shortcuts app
          </li>
          <li>📱 iOS 16+ compatible</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>App Info</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Price:</strong> Free; contains advertising
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Compatibility:</strong> iOS 16.0+, iPhone &amp; iPad
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>App Store Age Rating:</strong> 16+ (may vary by country or
          region)
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Developer:</strong> Keisuke Karijuku
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Legal</h2>
        <p>
          <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
        </p>
      </section>
