          by country or region)
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Developer:</strong> Keisuke Karijuku
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Legal</h2>
        <p>
          <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </Fragment>
